Maintainer: Jingsi Ming <jsming@fem.ecnu.edu.cn>
Description: Provides functions for the flexible integration of heterogeneous scRNA-seq datasets across multiple tissue types, platforms, and experimental batches. Implements the method described in Ming (2022) <doi:10.1093/bib/bbac167>. The package incorporates modified C++ source code from the flashpca library (Abraham, 2014-2016 <https://github.com/gabraham/flashpca>) for efficient principal component analysis; see 'inst/COPYRIGHTS' for details on third-party code and modifications. 
